{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2020b.q13.material.recovered", "text": "阅读材料，根据要求完成教学设计。《初识IP地址》是高中信息技术教材中的一课，通过本节课的学习，学生能够了解IP地址的概念、格式及分类；能够根据IP地址判断网络类型和对应的最大主机数目，知道IP地址的管理办法。教学准备：如图15和图16所示，李老师已为本课创建《初识 IP地址》微信公众号，主要包括“掌上学习”“课堂测试”“拓展资源”三个子菜单，“掌上学习”包括：①IP地址的概念文字材料；②IP地址格式讲解微视频；③IP地址分类的图文解析；④IP地址管理的视频。教学对象：高中二年级学生。学习方法：自主探究学习。学习环境：网络学习环境。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2af666d661b78a3223d95b71dfa0a84a166d1546b6d6c1c9648bc8d39b79770e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3036, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3304, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 13, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2af666d661b78a3223d95b71dfa0a84a166d1546b6d6c1c9648bc8d39b79770e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2020b.q13"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.415.r001", "ntce.outline.415.r023", "ntce.outline.415.r024", "ntce.outline.415.r025"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2020b.q13"], "word_count": 268, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2af666d661b78a3223d95b71dfa0a84a166d1546b6d6c1c9648bc8d39b79770e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3036, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3304, "next_source_question_number": 21, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section